Motion Primitives
https://github.com/ibelick/motion-primitives

The Disclosure, Dialog, and TransitionPanel components in this directory are
adapted from the upstream components/core source and documented public APIs.
Local changes remove Tailwind/utils/icon dependencies, compose native button
handlers, improve controlled state and accessible disclosure relationships,
retain native dialog focus/inert behavior through exit animations, restore
focus and body scrolling, and respect the user's reduced-motion preference.

